// ==============================================================================
// VerySync (微力同步) 过滤规则 - rime-snow-pinyin 专项目录
// 目标: D:\C2D\Documents\rime-snow-pinyin\.verysyncignore
// 策略: 保护双端 Rime 配置与核心词典；隔离 Weasel 单机二进制/LevelDB；过滤语料缓存与中间数据
// ==============================================================================

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. 小狼毫（Weasel）单机运行态与编译二进制（极高危：防 LevelDB 坏库与机器 ID 覆盖）
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)build
(?d)*.userdb
(?d)*.userdb.*
(?d)installation.yaml
(?d)user.yaml
// 说明：保留 /sync 目录，通过小狼毫自带的「用户资料同步」安全合并双端词频

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 2. 评测缓存、临时生成物与 Node.js 依赖 (包含 scripts/node_modules)
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)node_modules
(?d)cache
(?d)trash
(?d)cn_dicts_temp
(?d).worktrees

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 3. Python / Numba / Ruff 脚本与编译检查缓存
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)__pycache__
(?d)*.py[cod]
(?d)*.nbc
(?d)*.nbi
(?d).ruff_cache
(?d).pytest_cache

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 4. 算法搜索过程产生的大体积中间 JSON（仅保留核心前沿/种子汇总）
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)/research-notes/data/*b-paths*
(?d)/research-notes/data/*completion-v2*
(?d)/research-notes/data/*completion-ckt*
(?d)/research-notes/data/*constrained-continuation*
(?d)/research-notes/data/*elites-meta*
(?d)/research-notes/data/*all-historical-pools*

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 5. 主仓库及子 Git 仓库安全锁（保护 ice, pinyin-data, rime-easy-en, rime-stroke 等）
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.git/*.lock
**/.git/index.lock
**/.git/COMMIT_EDITMSG
**/.git/TAG_EDITMSG
**/.git/FETCH_HEAD
**/.git/ORIG_HEAD
**/.git/rebase-apply
**/.git/rebase-merge
.git/*.lock
.git/index.lock
.git/COMMIT_EDITMSG

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6. 通用现代编辑器单机状态与本地临时文件隔离
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Sublime Text
(?d)*.sublime-workspace

// VS Code / Cursor / Zed / Helix / JetBrains / Visual Studio
(?d).vscode/chrome
(?d).vscode/ipch
(?d).vscode/.browse.*
(?d).vscode/*.log
(?d).cursor/cache
(?d).cursor/state
(?d).zed/settings.local.json
(?d).helix/*.local.toml
(?d).helix/*.log
(?d).idea
(?d)*.suo
(?d)*.user
(?d)*.userosv
(?d)*.sln.docstates

// Vim / Neovim / 交换文件 / 临时文本 / Office 锁
(?d)*.swp
(?d)*.swn
(?d)*.swo
(?d)*~
(?d).netrwhist
(?d)~$*
(?d)*.tmp
(?d)*.bak
(?d)*.log
(?d)npm-debug.log*
(?d)yarn-debug.log*
(?d)pnpm-debug.log*
